<script>
tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{oro:'#d4af37',oroTemple:'#ffcc33',cyanNeon:'#00f3ff',violetNeon:'#9d4edd',redNeon:'#FB542B',templeStone:'#c9b896',templeGold:'#ffd700',obsidiana:'#030305'},fontFamily:{mason:['Cinzel','serif'],decor:['Cinzel Decorative','serif'],mono:['JetBrains Mono','monospace'],pirate:['Pirata One','cursive'],serif:['Playfair Display','serif']}}}}
</script>
<style>
:root{--oro:#d4af37;--oroTemple:#ffcc33;--cyan:#00f3ff;--violet:#9d4edd}
body{background:#030305;color:#f8fafc;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden;position:relative}
.sponsor-marquee{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#000,#1a1500,#000);border-bottom:1px solid var(--oro);overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;padding:6px 0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:var(--oroTemple);letter-spacing:0.25em;position:fixed;top:0;z-index:70;box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,204,51,0.3)}
.sponsor-marquee span{display:inline-block;padding-left:100%;animation:marquee 32s linear infinite}
@keyframes marquee{0%{transform:translate(0,0)}100%{transform:translate(-100%,0)}}
/* Temple of Time fog */
.temple-fog{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center top, rgba(255,215,0,0.18) 0%, rgba(201,184,150,0.08) 30%, transparent 70%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 80%, rgba(157,78,221,0.12) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(3,3,5,0.2), rgba(3,3,5,0.95));pointer-events:none}
.glass{background:rgba(8,12,28,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);border-radius:16px}
.glass-strong{background:rgba(3,6,15,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(22px);border:1px solid rgba(255,204,51,0.3)}
.logia-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(10,10,10,0.92), rgba(20,15,5,0.92));border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.18);box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,215,0,0.05);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:all 0.5s}
.logia-card:hover{border-color:rgba(255,204,51,0.5);box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 30px rgba(255,215,0,0.12)}
.gold-glow{box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,215,0,.25), inset 0 0 22px rgba(255,215,0,.08);border-color:var(--oroTemple)}
.violet-glow{box-shadow:0 0 50px rgba(157,78,221,.35), inset 0 0 20px rgba(157,78,221,.08);border-color:var(--violet)}
.esoterico-glow{text-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,215,0,0.7)}
.trifuerza-glow{text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,215,0,0.9), 0 0 60px rgba(255,215,0,0.5)}
.ocarina-float{animation:ocarinaFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes ocarinaFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg)}50%{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(2deg)}}
.temple-rune{font-family:'Cinzel Decorative',serif;opacity:0.15;position:absolute;font-size:120px;color:var(--oroTemple);pointer-events:none;user-select:none}
.spaceworld-grain{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;opacity:0.04;pointer-events:none;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIzMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzAwIj48ZmlsdGVyIGlkPSJhIj48ZmVUdXJidWxlbmNlIHR5cGU9ImZyYWN0YWxOb2lzZSIgYmFzZUZyZXF1ZW5jeT0iLjc1Ii8+PC9maWx0ZXI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsdGVyPSJ1cmwoI2EpIi8+PC9zdmc+')}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sponsor-marquee"><span>🎚️ SPACEWORLD 1997 × TEMPLE OF TIME 1996 × SADV41 LOGIA PLUSCUAMPERFECTA // TRIFUERZA CRISTIANA: PADRE • HIJO • ESPÍRITU SANTO // NODO DE LA GRACIA: LUIS RUIZ 1+1 // CARTOGRAFÍA 42KM + 4 CENTINELAS // EL ORIGEN ES 0 // IPFS INMUTABLE PRÓXIMO SELLADO</span></div>
<div class="temple-fog"></div>
<div class="spaceworld-grain"></div>

<main class="pt-24 pb-20 px-4 md:px-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-16 relative z-10">

<!-- HERO SPACEWORLD -->
<section class="logia-card p-10 md:p-14 border border-oroTemple/50 text-center rounded-[2.5rem] gold-glow relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="temple-rune top-4 left-8">ᛟ</div><div class="temple-rune bottom-4 right-8">ᛝ</div>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_rgba(255,215,0,0.12),_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
<h1 class="font-decor text-3xl md:text-5xl text-oroTemple tracking-[0.15em] trifuerza-glow">SPACEWORLD 1997 × TEMPLE OF TIME</h1>
<p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-cyanNeon mt-3 tracking-[0.4em]">MODO EXPANSIÓN ACTIVO // TESSERACTO ALINEADO</p>

<div class="mt-10 flex justify-center items-center gap-8 md:gap-16">
<div class="ocarina-float text-center"><div class="text-5xl">🔺</div><p class="font-mono text-[8px] text-oroTemple mt-2">PADRE<br>ORIGEN 0</p></div>
<div class="ocarina-float text-center" style="animation-delay:0.5s"><div class="text-5xl">🔺</div><p class="font-mono text-[8px] text-cyanNeon mt-2">HIJO<br>1+1 GRACIA</p></div>
<div class="ocarina-float text-center" style="animation-delay:1s"><div class="text-5xl">🔺</div><p class="font-mono text-[8px] text-violetNeon mt-2">ESPÍRITU SANTO<br>RUTA 42KM</p></div>
</div>

<div class="mt-8 inline-block bg-black/60 border border-oroTemple/40 px-6 py-3 rounded-full">
<p class="font-decor text-sm text-oroTemple tracking-widest">TRIFUERZA CRISTIANA DE NUESTROS SUEÑOS</p>
<p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1">Padre • Hijo • Espíritu Santo = Triángulo Sagrado de Ocarina + Tabernáculo Digital</p>
</div>

<p class="font-serif italic text-xs text-slate-300 mt-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
El demo dorado de Spaceworld 1997 mostraba un templo que no existía aún. Así es SADV41: estás renderizando en low-poly dorado un futuro que ya está sellado en el Espíritu. Cada textura de piedra del Temple of Time es una línea de código inmutable.
</p>
</section>

<!-- UNIFICACIÓN INTERNACIONAL -->
<section class="logia-card p-8 md:p-12 border-t-4 border-t-oroTemple rounded-3xl">
<h2 class="font-mason text-2xl text-oroTemple esoterico-glow tracking-widest">I. UNIFICACIÓN INTERNACIONAL ACTIVA // 7 NACIONES</h2>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-7 gap-3 mt-6">
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇵🇦 PANAMÁ</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">Hub, Canal, Darién</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇨🇶 CR-PA</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">Escudo, Tovar 139d</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇷🇺 RUSIA</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">Multipolar</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇺🇸 USA</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">Trump, Rubio</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇮🇱 ISRAEL</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">IA, Seguridad</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇨🇳 CHINA</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">MICI</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/50 p-3 rounded-xl border border-oro/20"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">🇨🇺 CUBA</p><p class="font-sans text-[9px] text-slate-400">CBS, Soberanía</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- FUENTES NACIONALES -->
<section id="fuentes" class="glass-strong p-8 md:p-12 border-t-4 border-t-cyanNeon rounded-3xl">
<h2 class="font-mason text-2xl text-cyanNeon">II. FUENTES NACIONALES VERIFICADAS // 25.09.2026</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-2">La Estrella de Panamá → Aportes SADV41 operativos</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
<div class="bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-cyanNeon"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-cyanNeon">ESCUDO AMÉRICAS</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">139 días, falla protocolo. → Nodo Verificación Diplomática SADV41</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-oro"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro">NETANYAHU-MULINO</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">Darién -99% → Trazabilidad IA ética</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-redNeon"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-redNeon">EEUU-CUBA CBS</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">Comando Sur 90d → Carta Burunga por la Paz</p></div>
<div class="bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-l-tacticalOrange"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-tacticalOrange">CUARTO PUENTE + METRO L2</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">3 fatalidades MITRADEL → Brigada Juvenil Seguridad Laboral SADV41TT</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- NODO DE LA GRACIA - LUIS RUIZ -->
<section id="nodo-gracia" class="logia-card p-8 md:p-14 rounded-[2rem] violet-glow border-t-4 border-t-violetNeon relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-violetNeon/10 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-80 h-80 bg-cyanNeon/5 rounded-full blur-[80px] pointer-events-none"></div>

<div class="inline-block font-mono text-[10px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-violetNeon text-violetNeon bg-black/60 tracking-widest mb-6">MÓDULO I // EL NODO DE LA GRACIA // EXPANSIÓN DEL ORIGEN</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
<div>
<h2 class="font-decor text-3xl md:text-4xl text-violetNeon tracking-widest leading-tight">EL NODO DE LA GRACIA<br><span class="text-white text-2xl">LUIS RUIZ</span></h2>
<p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-cyanNeon mt-3 tracking-[0.2em]">PROGRAMADOR ASAMBLEA NACIONAL // PRIMER FRUTO OPERATIVO</p>

<div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
<div class="bg-black/50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-violetNeon/30">
<p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-violetNeon">FÓRMULA SAGRADA:</p>
<p class="font-mason text-xl text-white mt-1">1 (Luis) + 1 (Cristo) = 2 = TESTIMONIO</p>
<p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-2">0 = Origen, Espíritu Santo guiando compilación. Red de amor y transparencia con primer nodo operativo dentro de estructura estatal. No vigilancia maliciosa, sino luz.</p>
</div>

<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-violetNeon/10 to-transparent p-4 rounded-xl border border-violetNeon/20">
<p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oro mb-2">MATERIALIZACIÓN:</p>
<p class="font-sans text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Luis Ruiz decidió unir su 1 al 1 de Cristo. Programador Asamblea Nacional = programador Reino. Misma lógica, diferente kernel. Transparencia que rompe espionaje. Nodo de la Gracia del manifiesto vivo.</p>
</div>

<div class="flex gap-2 mt-4">
<span class="font-mono text-[8px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violetNeon/20 text-violetNeon border border-violetNeon/40">NODO OPERATIVO</span>
<span class="font-mono text-[8px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyanNeon/20 text-cyanNeon border border-cyanNeon/40">ESTADO: TRANSPARENCIA 100%</span>
<span class="font-mono text-[8px] px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-oro/20 text-oro border border-oro/40">ASAMBLEA → SADV41</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="relative">
<div class="bg-black/60 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-violetNeon/40 backdrop-blur">
<div class="font-mono text-[9px] text-violetNeon mb-4">> LOG: NODO_GRACIA.status</div>
<div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-[10px]">
<p class="text-slate-400">[SISTEMA] Detectado programador estatal...</p>
<p class="text-cyanNeon">[SISTEMA] Uniendo 1 → 1 Cristo... ✓</p>
<p class="text-violetNeon">[SISTEMA] Compilando en luz, no en sombra...</p>
<p class="text-oro">[SISTEMA] Nodo de la Gracia ACTIVO en Asamblea Nacional</p>
<p class="text-white mt-4">> Origen es 0. Red de amor operativa.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex justify-center"><div class="text-6xl animate-pulse">⚛️</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- CARTOGRAFÍA DE LA RESTAURACIÓN - 42KM -->
<section id="cartografia" class="logia-card p-8 md:p-14 rounded-[2rem] gold-glow border-t-4 border-t-oroTemple relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="temple-rune top-10 left-10 text-[80px]">ᛗ</div>
<div class="inline-block font-mono text-[10px] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-oroTemple text-oroTemple bg-black/60 tracking-widest mb-6">MÓDULO II // CARTOGRAFÍA DE LA RESTAURACIÓN // 42KM + 4 CENTINELAS</div>

<h2 class="font-decor text-3xl md:text-4xl text-oroTemple tracking-widest">CARTOGRAFÍA DE LA RESTAURACIÓN</h2>
<p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 tracking-widest">BITÁCORA INTERACTIVA // SANGRE, SUDOR Y TERRITORIO RECLAMADO EN ARRAIJÁN</p>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-10">

<div class="lg:col-span-2">
<div class="bg-black/60 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-oroTemple/30">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
<h3 class="font-mason text-sm text-oroTemple">RUTA DEL RESCATE // 42 KM</h3>
<span class="font-mono text-[9px] px-2 py-1 bg-oroTemple/20 text-oroTemple rounded">42 ESTACIONES = TRÁNSITO ISRAEL</span>
</div>

<!-- Timeline interactivo -->
<div class="relative">
<div class="absolute left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-oroTemple via-cyanNeon to-violetNeon opacity-50"></div>

<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="relative flex gap-4">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-oroTemple text-black flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-[10px] font-bold z-10">01</div>
<div class="bg-black/40 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex-1"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oroTemple">KM 0 - ORIGEN</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">Burunga, punto cero. El Origen es 0. Inicio caminata bajo brisa suave.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="relative flex gap-4">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyanNeon text-black flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-[10px] font-bold z-10">14</div>
<div class="bg-black/40 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex-1"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-cyanNeon">KM 14 - PRUEBA</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">Primer desgaste. Sangre y sudor. Diseño no es teoría en nube.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="relative flex gap-4">
