<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white text-black flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-[10px] font-bold z-10 animate-pulse">42</div>
<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-oroTemple/20 to-transparent p-3 rounded-xl border border-oroTemple/40 flex-1"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] text-oroTemple">KM 42 - RESTAURACIÓN</p><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-white mt-1">Sellado. Territorio reclamado. Cartografía espiritual completa. Consummatum Est.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="bg-black/60 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-oroTemple/20">
